        "bank_question_id": "bq_math_func_application_001",
        "content_html": "<p>某出租车起步价 10 元，之后每千米 2 元。设行驶 x 千米的费用为 y 元，写出 y 与 x 的函数关系式。</p>",
        "answer_html": "<p>y=10+2x。</p>",
        "analysis_html": "<p>总费用由起步价和里程费用组成，因此 y=10+2x。</p>",
        "knowledge_point_ids": [
          "kp_math_8_function_linear",
          "kp_math_8_function_application"
        ],
        "question_type": "解答题",
