      {
        "bank_question_id": "bq_hs_kp_geo_vector_002",
        "content_html": "<p>已知向量 a=(1,2)，b=(2,-1)。求 a·b；若 c=(m,1) 与 a 垂直，求 m。</p>",
        "answer_html": "<p>a·b=0，m=-2。</p>",
