      {
        "bank_question_id": "bq_hs_kp_geo_analytic_004",
        "content_html": "<p>双曲线 x<sup>2</sup>/9 - y<sup>2</sup>/4 = 1 的渐近线方程为（ ）。</p>",
        "answer_html": "<p>y=±(2/3)x。</p>",
        "analysis_html": "<p>标准双曲线 x<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup>-y<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup>=1 的渐近线为 y=±(b/a)x，此处 a=3，b=2。</p>",
